#
# What works: the admission burst window (TF_DSV41_BATCH_HOLD_MS) forms a 4-request batch; the lane core calls
# backend.prefill_many; the slots restore/reset; forwardSegs runs one forward over the concatenated suffixes and
# the row-wise layers (embedding, router, routed experts, shared expert, mHC) are shared. `Logits.segments`
# returns each segment's last row (one logits row a stream) and each stream's keep hook fires at its own end.
#
# What stops it: the attention cannot yet run a MANY-ROW segment.
