#     -> error.MissingAttentionSelection, because the index selection is staged per (layer, position, rows)
#        and a segment's CONSUMER layer reads whatever the LAST segment's SOURCE layer left in the one
#        selection buffer.
# The next build is a per-segment selection (row-indexed picks + per-row positions), not a new kernel.
